he 4-stage website lifecycle.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Progress\n- **Architecture & Conclave (Blueprint)**: Completed.\n  - Decision logged to [`~/.gemini/decisions/raw/2026-10-20-15-dollar-real-tick-engine.md`\n<truncated 3534 bytes>\n Production URL**: `https://grok-bot-dashboard.pages.dev`\n- **Latest Deployment**: `https://c179d780.grok-bot-dashboard.pages.dev` (Task `task-1752` completed)\n- **Pending verification**: Need to run `vibe-audit url https://grok-bot-dashboard.pages.dev` to verify live site security grade, update companion HUD to completed, and provide final report.\n\n---\n\n### 5. Next Steps (Immediate Resumption Priority)\n1. **Live URL Security Verification**:\n   - Run `/Users/dev/.gemini/antigravity/bin/vibe-audit url https://grok-bot-dashboard.pages.dev` to verify live Grade A.\n2. **Companion HUD & Work State Update**:\n   - Run:\n     `python3 /Users/dev/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/heyclicky-companion/set_agent_status.py Forge completed \"$15 Real-Tick Bybit Engine deployed & active\"`\n     `python3 /Users/dev/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/heyclicky-companion/set_agent_status.py Shield completed \"Live security audit verified A (100/100)\"`\n   - Update `claude-mem` `work_state_write`: mark task as `done`.\n3. **User Presentation**:\n   - Emit concise completion summary with live URL, explaining how to watch the real-time position HUD and compounding balance.\n\n---\n\n### 6. Commitments & Constraints\n- **Zero Real Money Risk**: Bankroll is \\$15.00 paper capital, while market data, entries, exits, fees, and price fluctuations are 100% real.\n- **Ponytail/Caveman Rules**: Terse output, <=3 lines of prose, bullet/code first, clickable file/URL links.\n</summary>\n\nYou have the 1 following artifacts written to the artifacts directory:\n\n[ARTIFACT: media_1792399183377_cd5dbcd4]\nPath: file:///Users/dev/.gemini/antigravity/brain/fbbefb03-c012-4cd6-882c-39f6295a6918/.user_uploaded/media_1792399183377_cd5dbcd4.png\nLast Edited: 2026-10-19T08:39:49Z\n\n#